README.md
# Institutional Operating System Validator (IOS Validator)

The IOS Validator validates institutional architectures against the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System.

It evaluates whether institutions comply with governance, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure, AI governance, institutional memory, interoperability, and capability standards.

---

## Features

- Governance validation
- Procurement validation
- DPI validation
- AI governance validation
- Capability assessment
- Institutional maturity scoring
- Risk identification
- Standards compliance

---

## Validation Pipeline

```
Institution

↓

JSON Input

↓

Schema Validation

↓

Standards Validation

↓

Governance Validation

↓

Capability Validation

↓

Risk Analysis

↓

Compliance Report
```

---

## API

POST /validate

POST /governance

POST /procurement

POST /capability

POST /dpi

POST /ai

GET /health

---

## Output

- Validation Score
- Compliance Score
- Capability Score
- Risk Summary
- Recommendations
